<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>IcantTapstrafe</Major>
    <Description>Hi Friends!!

I made a new macro for apex legends which allows you to easy bunnyhow and tapstrafe with it.

This is how it works:

1. Bind the macro to a mousebutton or space.
2. Go into the apex settings and bind jump to scroll wheel down.
3. Go in the apex settings again and bind move forward to scroll wheel up.
4. Hold the button you got the macro on.

Try the macro in the firing range first to get used to it!! </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>WheelUp 1
Delay 5 ms
WheelDown 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>